additional.description:
Formulae are needed to generate Fig5D in the paper. This file contains the new assignments for the formulae.

ptotFull = (rAFull .* pAFull + ((100 - rAFull) .* pBFull)) / 100;
pAFull = 100 * (2 * sp * pApA + pApB)/(2 * sp * pApA + sp * STAT5A + pApB);
pBFull = 100 * (2 * (1-sp) * pBpB + pApB)/(2 * (1-sp) * pBpB + (1-sp) * STAT5B + pApB);
rAFull = 100 * (2 * sp * pApA + sp * STAT5A + pApB)/(2 * sp * pApA + 2 * (1-sp) * pBpB + 2 * pApB + sp * STAT5A + (1-sp) * STAT5B);

ptotFull = average degree of STAT5A phosphorylation
sp = antibody specificity (0.107)

